MANIFEST

# PyInstaller
#  Usually these files are written by a python script from a template
#  before PyInstaller builds the exe, so as to inject date/other infos into it.
*.manifest
*.spec

# Installer logs
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt

# Unit test / coverage reports
htmlcov/
.tox/
.nox/
.coverage
.coverage.*
.cache
nosetests.xml
coverage.xml
*.cover
*.py,cover
.hypothesis/
.pytest_cache/
cover/

# Translations
*.mo
*.pot

# Django stuff:
*.log
# The application's own handler is a RotatingFileHandler with backupCount=5 (core/runtime.py), so it
# also writes app.log.1 through app.log.5, which *.log does not match - they showed up as untracked
# files ready to be committed, and a request log is not something to put in the repository.
*.log.[0-9]*
# Local scratch output from guard/script runs — never ship these.
.guardlogs/
local_settings.py
db.sqlite3
db.sqlite3-journal

